      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 796075429,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "When importing a \"random\" file I get multiple warning popups. I think this should be only one warning popup, with possible multiple warning lines. Also note the whitespace issue after the offset number containing space or newline.\n\n```\nRunning in no offset mode but read offset, ignoring\n\nRunning in no offset mode but read offset (0000 ) at start of file, treating as preamble\n\nRunning in no offset mode but read offset (0044\n) at start of file, treating as preamble\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 4753670,
            "username": "stigbjorlykke",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Stig Bjørlykke",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/905aafc6b50e246885f5ea9273a9dc4f22e2658b71f9a1b551b797082bec3f80?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/stigbjorlykke"
          },
          "created_at": "2021-12-27T17:49:38.994Z",
          "updated_at": "2021-12-27T18:25:55.200Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 132680134,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": true,
          "resolved_by": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/johnthacker"
          },
          "resolved_at": "2021-12-28T16:22:31.457Z",
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 5568,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 796114625,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I agree, I'll do the same thing as with the timecode, where the popup only appears once. Multiple popups is a pain. The automatic suppression of duplicate pop-ups is nice, but doesn't work when the messages aren't identical.\n\nGood catch with the whitespace and linebreak issue. Due to the parser, the token should include a single character from `[: \\t\\r\\n]` so it probably looks best to remove that instead of escaping.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
